UnitPPYieldTokenZap::constructor
├── It reverts when vault is zero
├── It reverts when pool is zero
└── It reverts when underlying is zero

UnitPPYieldTokenZap::depositUnderlying
├── It reverts on zero amount
└── It credits receiver not caller

UnitPPYieldTokenZap::redeemToUnderlying
├── It reverts on zero shares
└── It sends underlying to receiver not caller

UnitPPYieldTokenZap::buyFixedYieldToken
├── It mints exact shares to receiver
├── It reverts when max underlying too low
└── It reverts when shares is zero

UnitPPYieldTokenZap::quoteBuy
└── It equals preview mint plus rounding buffer
